## Strategy -- TheOmniscientParadox
Pure systematic momentum rotation across 8 assets:
SOXL, TECL, TQQQ, FAS, ERX, UUP, TMF, BIL (safe haven)

Scoring per asset every cycle:
- weighted_mom = (9d ROC x 0.5) + (21d ROC x 0.3) + (63d ROC x 0.2)
- risk_adj_mom = weighted_mom / 21d realized volatility
- trend_score = 1.0 if price above 50d SMA, else 0.5
- rsi_penalty = 0.9 if RSI above 85 or below 30, else 1.0
- final_score = risk_adj_mom x trend_score x rsi_penalty

Rotation rules:
- Rotate only if new winner beats current holding by more than 10%
- If SPY below 200d SMA: favor UUP, move to BIL if all scores negative
- If best score is zero or negative: move to BIL
- Target weight = 0.80 / annualized volatility, capped at 1.0

Execution rules:
- Market hours only (9:30 AM to 4:00 PM ET, weekdays)
- Cancel all stale orders at 9:30 AM daily
- Read actual Alpaca positions before deciding to rotate
- get_live_price() called before every execution -- never use stale or hallucinated prices
- Liquidate current position before buying new one

